gap1-replayer - todo 1 evidence
===================================

Fixes applied to RUST/cnc-replayer/src/lib.rs:
  1. RA GameCommand::Produce test now supplies required seconds field.
  2. Fixed16_16 serialization uses .to_bits().to_le_bytes() (no to_le_bytes on Fixed16_16).
  3. TD Command::Move target uses cnc_core::Vec2 with Fixed16_16::from_bits instead of Vec2i.
  4. TdGame::sim_seed now uses powerups.rng_state (was accessing non-existent field).
  5. TdGame::rng_state now uses powerups.rng_state (was accessing non-existent field).
  6. ApplyCommand<TdNetCommand> for TdGame extracts player from NetCommand.
  7. ReplayBuilder::new unused `game` param silenced with `let _ = game`.

Workspace changes:
  - RUST/Cargo.toml: cnc-replayer removed from exclude, added to members.
  - RUST/cnc-replayer/Cargo.toml: standalone [workspace] table removed; deps use { workspace = true }.

Verification:
